== Walkthrough ==

Upon creating a Gnome Wizard who doesn't follow Bertoxxulous, you will have a Registration Letter in your inventory. The note reads as follows:

: Greetings young pupil, your new school awaits you.  Seek out the Eldritch Collective at the Library Mechanimagica.  Give this Registration Letter to master [[Tobon Starpyre]], he will introduce you to your new course of studies.

Upon handing the letter to [[Tobon Starpyre]]:

: [[Tobon Starpyre]] says, 'Ah..  Welcome, friend!  I am Tobon Starpyre, Master Wizard of Library Mechanimagica.  This is our tunic - wear it with pride.  Study hard, master your skills, and make us proud. '

<div class='facblock'>

* Your faction standing with [[Eldritch Collective]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Gem Choppers]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[King Ak'Anon]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Merchants of Ak'Anon]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Dark Reflection]] got worse.
* Your faction standing with [[The Dead]] got worse.

</div>

{{YouGainExperience}}

You also receive the [[Dirty Gold Felt Robe*]]. Good luck, Wizard!

